Independent color-algorithm reference
------------------------------------
The natural-warm color profile was independently implemented with the numerical
behavior of the einkwarm natural/std/Floyd-Steinberg profile as a reference:
https://github.com/atunverse/moink/tree/081af81ec05c6a66f9fe6d5f598bcf229eff8723
The referenced implementation and web-page source are not included. This reference
credit does not describe moink as MIT-licensed or relicense its source code.

A1 display-driver compatibility fix
----------------------------------
firmware/esp32-c3-a1 contains independently written compatibility code, build
tools and synthetic verification tests for one exact existing firmware image.
The observed A1 register/window/refresh contract was compared with:
https://github.com/atunverse/moink/tree/081af81ec05c6a66f9fe6d5f598bcf229eff8723
https://github.com/krstc/InkSight_adapt_HUAWEI_eink/tree/78ceea65ec754fcacc3a9a6036416b755bd2f64c
Original upstream driver source and the base firmware are not part of this Git
source tree. Application upgrade binaries are distributed separately in Releases
with firmware reference notices; source builds require a matching base image. These
references do not relicense Moink source or grant redistribution rights to a
supplied binary. The original InkSight MIT notice above remains intact.

